      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pato Selvagem. Farfetch'd não consegue viver sem o talo que carrega. Por isso, defende-o dos agressores com a própria vida.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 3 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Farfetch'd não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Brave Bird, Fury Cutter, Leer, Peck, Poison Jab, Sand Attack, Struggle, Struggle, Struggle, Struggle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Aerial Ace, Fury Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Cut, Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Air Cutter, Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Swords Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Agility, Night Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Air Slash, False Swipe, Feint</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Leaf Blade</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Air Slash, Attract, Brutal Swing, Confide, Covet, Defog, Double Team, Dual Wingbeat, Facade, False Swipe, Fly, Frustration, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Laser Focus, Last Resort, Poison Jab, Protect, Psych Up, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Roost, Round, Sky Attack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Blade, Steel Wing, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Tailwind, Thief, Throat Chop, Toxic, U-turn, Uproar, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Covet, Curse, Feather Dance, Feint, Final Gambit, First Impression, Flail, Foresight, Gust, Leaf Blade, Mirror Move, Mud-Slap, Night Slash, Quick 